<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2538_9797.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig dienste, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambt</unclear> was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermoegend zuovor. Fromm, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>, insonnders guot fründ unnd gethrüw
<lb n="4"/>lieb <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear></orgName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uß</unclear> üwerm schryben
<lb n="5"/>und postscripto <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habend</unclear> wir mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerem</unclear> verstanden,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wasmaßen</unclear> sich das frömbde gegen dem hertzogthumb
<lb n="7"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-311" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Meyland</placeName> ziechende kriegsvolck von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-87" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Roschach</placeName> naher
<lb n="8"/>biß gen <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-33" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Liechtensteig</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschwelt</unclear> habe, unnd was üwer
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begehren</unclear> deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">paßes</unclear> halber inn den landman <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syge</unclear>.
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thuond</unclear> unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorderist</unclear> der üwern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verthruwliche</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichts</unclear> comunication gantz fründtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedancken</unclear>,
<lb n="12"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füegend</unclear> üch inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">antwordt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinwider</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eydtgnößisch</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvernëmmen</unclear>, das unns ouch schrifft: und mundt-
<lb n="14"/>lichen bericht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ynkommen</unclear>, das sich diß volck glychergstalt
<lb n="15"/>von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-225" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rappershwyl</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dannen</unclear> biß gegen dem <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gothart</unclear></persName>
<lb n="16"/>uffhalte und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samble</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wovern</unclear> wir nun die ur-
<lb n="17"/>sachen deßelben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkhundiget</unclear>, habend wir anders
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nütjit</unclear> inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfahrung</unclear> bringen koennen, dann das
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> volck <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßwëgen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gothart</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüwem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überschnydt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Urnersee</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungestümen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">winderhigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wätters</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entstanden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syge</unclear>,
