<lb n="38"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewerttig</unclear> sind. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vnnd</unclear> waß sy nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßwäg</unclear>-
<lb n="39"/>en Jnn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewüße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfahrung</unclear> bringen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear>,
<lb n="40"/>deßen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllent</unclear> Jr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnuerzogenlich</unclear> berichtet werden. Daß aber
